american-02.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-WardDavis1999-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-WardDavis1999_4-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFH.&#95;Trawick&#95;WardR.&#95;P.&#95;Stephen&#95;Davis1999\" class=\"citation book\">H. Trawick Ward; R. P. Stephen Davis. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://books.google.com/books?id=0vVOdOSIv_cC&amp;pg=PA2\">Time before history: the archaeology of North Carolina</a>. UNC Press Books. 1999: 2 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2011-11-29</span>&#93;</span>. <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-8078-4780-0\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-8078-4780-0\"><span title=\"國際標準書號\">ISBN</span>&#160;978-0-8078-4780-0</a>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20161230181918/https://books.google.com/books?id=0vVOdOSIv_cC&amp;pg=PA2\">存檔</a>於2016-12-30）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%8F%A4%E5%8D%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%89%E4%BA%BA&amp;rft.au=H.+Trawick+Ward&amp;rft.au=R.+P.+Stephen+Davis&amp;rft.btitle=Time+before+history%3A+the+archaeology+of+North+Carolina&amp;rft.date=1999&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-8078-4780-0&amp;rft.pages=2&amp;rft.pub=UNC+Press+Books&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3D0vVOdOSIv&#95;cC%26pg%3DPA2&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Phillips-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Phillips_5-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw